Once `refresh` finishes, only `broadcastState()` runs (line 759). The Library is never told to re-list, so those cards stay wrong until some unrelated library change. The PR's renderer-side move and drag guards read that list.

Fix: call `host?.broadcastLibraryChanged()` after line 755 when the relocated workspace is the active one. Alternatively, detect the chosen folder before the transaction commits."}],"contracts":[{"action":"After "Change folder…" succeeds, re-detect the workspace's sync provider and return its view with availability and sync","location":"apps/kaipu-record/src/main/workspaces/index.ts:753-763","equivalent_path":"createWorkspace (index.ts:628-647) and addWorkspace (index.ts:578) call syncStates.refresh right after the registry write and before any switch or broadcast. initWorkspaces refreshes every entry at launch (index.ts:115).","before_after":"In createWorkspace, refresh runs before runSwitch, so the switch's afterCommit re-list already sees the detected provider. In relocateFolder, the active workspace's transaction (relocateActive, switch-transaction.ts:100-141) commits and fires afterCommit's broadcastLibraryChanged (index.ts:524-530) before refresh at line 755. After the refresh, only broadcastState runs (line 759), with no library re-list.","visible_effect":"The returned workspace view and the broadcast state show the detected provider. The Library listing made during the commit used the path-rule answer (sync-state.ts:26-30). For an xattr-only Drive folder, that listing has no eviction probe (library/index.ts:71-74) and stays that way until the next library change.","failure_mode":"detectSync never throws and bounds each step at the timeout (synced-folder.ts:74-91), so refresh cannot reject. A timed-out step reads as not synced, and the workspace is then treated as a plain folder until the next launch or relocate. availabilityOf is bounded for synced entries (index.ts:176-193).","status":"closed","evidence":["apps/kaipu-record/src/main/workspaces/index.ts:524-530","apps/kaipu-record/src/main/workspaces/index.ts:628-647","apps/kaipu-record/src/main/workspaces/index.ts:176-193","apps/kaipu-record/src/main/workspaces/index.ts:368-370","apps/kaipu-record/src/main/